      "text": "# Greeter\nA small greeting utility.\n\n## Usage\nRun the following Python code from the project directory:\n\n```python\nfrom greeter import greet\n\nprint(greet(\"Alice\"))\n```\n\nOutput:\n\n```text\nHello, Alice!\n```\n\nThe `greet` function returns a greeting for the supplied name, and `print` displays it.\n"
    },
